---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Shipping & Delivery | David Dindi" description="Delivery options, costs and timeframes are confirmed before an order is finalised.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/policies/how-to-order/">Policies</a> / Shipping</div><span class="eyebrow">Customer information</span><h1>Shipping & Delivery</h1><p class="lead">Delivery options, costs and timeframes are confirmed before an order is finalised.</p></div></section>
  <section class="container content">
    <h2>Delivery arrangements</h2>
    <p>Shipping availability, courier options, delivery costs and estimated timeframes must be confirmed for each order before it is finalised.</p>
    <h2>Lead times</h2>
    <p>Ready-to-ship items and made-to-order or custom manufacturing projects may have different lead times. The applicable estimate should be confirmed in writing.</p>
    <h2>Delivery details</h2>
    <p>Customers should provide a complete and accurate delivery address and contact number. Any delivery restrictions or additional charges should be discussed before payment.</p>
    <div class="notice"><strong>Owner review required:</strong> do not publish free-shipping promises or fixed delivery times until rates, areas, courier arrangements and exceptions are confirmed.</div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>